    "summary": "A multidisciplinary discovery program integrating plant biology, microbiome science, metabolomics, bioinformatics and AI/ML to identify reproducible biological relationships and prioritize experimentally testable mechanisms.",
    "research_question": "Can integrated plant, microbial and metabolomic data reveal context-dependent biological relationships and candidate bioactive mechanisms that are missed when each domain is studied independently?",
    "working_hypothesis": "Joint modelling of plant, metabolomic and microbial features will identify reproducible cross-domain associations and candidate mechanisms suitable for targeted experimental validation.",
